        },
        {
          "text": "Isirairi akagiremera emyaka amakumi ana; akalema emyaka musanju ali Hebburooni, kandi emyaka asatu n'esatu ali Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
